00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:29.430
that are out there, tools,
samples, libraries,

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.260
blog posts, everything is there.

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:33.390
So definitely go check that out.

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:34.980
And from here, I already
did it a little bit.

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:35.340
Thank you.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.370
Thank you so much,
contributors, for everything

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:41.400
that you've been doing
in all shape or form.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.200
We really, really appreciate it.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.850
It is kind of like
easy to forget

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.230
in like the day-to-day business,

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:49.410
but we do really appreciate
all the time and the effort

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:50.550
that you put into there.

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:53.340
And especially with like the
new tools in the MAUIverse,

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:56.730
in the Discord server, it is
so easy now to collaborate,

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:59.730
more easier now than ever,
which we definitely also do.

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:01.620
So please keep doing that.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:04.650
Then we have, of course,
like our partners,

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:05.880
our component vendors, right?

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:09.390
All of the friends that
build on top of.NET MAUI

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:10.680
with their own controls,

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:14.190
with their own little
ecosystem, with own tooling.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:17.400
So of course, go check those
out if you have like a favorite

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:19.920
from maybe another part
of the ecosystem in.NET.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.890
These are the names that you
want to check out if you want

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:27.030
to have some pre-built
really amazing things.

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:30.810
Speaking of which, the partners
that we have really help

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:32.520
where.NET MAUI can go.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.860
Because in the past
couple of months,

00:12:34.860 --> 00:12:38.040
we have announced a couple
of very cool collaborations

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.530
with some of our partners,
some of our friends.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:42.540
First of which is Syncfusion.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:44.310
Maybe you've heard
