00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:06.420
which is now at version 1.0.10
with 30-plus UI controls.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:09.480
I think some of them came from
like the paid Syncfusion suite,

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.520
now available to you for free.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.160
Definitely go check that
out, which are built

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:16.770
