with customization,

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.020
with accessibility in mind.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.390
They will fit right
into your.NET MAUI app.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:23.190
So definitely go check that out.

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:25.770
And from this place, thank
you so much, Syncfusion,

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:29.460
for being a great partner
throughout years at this point.

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:30.480
So that's really great.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.750
And also them, they have been
speeding up as well, right?

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.780
They have seen, there is
