00:23:03.090 --> 00:23:04.800
up nicely in your application.

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:05.790
Doesn't it look beautiful?

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:07.320
I think it looks beautiful.

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:09.690
And here another example
on Android where we kind

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:11.310
of like have the
top space, right?

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:14.010
You can see the top space right
there on the left screenshot

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:16.350
with the default behavior,

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:18.900
not-so-great-looking white
bar there at the top.

00:23:18.900 --> 00:23:22.980
But now with the new API
SafeArea edges to none,

