00:35:04.560 --> 00:35:05.750
Some others might not.

00:35:05.750 --> 00:35:09.230
But this is a place where
we are trying to come

00:35:09.230 --> 00:35:10.340
up with some cool new things.

00:35:10.340 --> 00:35:12.830
And of course, you're welcome
