application and verify itself,

00:35:25.590 --> 00:35:29.040
which will make it so much more
effective while working with it.

00:35:29.040 --> 00:35:32.640
The Essentials.ai, where
you can, you know, again,

00:35:32.640 --> 00:35:34.410
following the
paradigm of.NET MAUI,

00:35:34.410 --> 00:35:37.920
you can use the
on-device AI services.

00:35:37.920 --> 00:35:42.840
Apple Intelligence, Gemini on
Android, SilicaPi, I don't know

00:35:42.840 --> 00:35:45.300
if I pronounced it
correctly, on Windows.

00:35:45.300 --> 00:35:46.470
So you can use those there.

00:35:46.470 --> 00:35:49.530
And of course, local models
and also remote models.

00:35:49.530 --> 00:35:52.230
So this is a great library
that you will want

00:35:52.230 --> 00:35:54.630
to have whenever you
want to incorporate AI

00:35:54.630 --> 00:35:57.180
in your application
for your end user.

00:35:57.180 --> 00:36:00.600
Then AI extensions, we're
also looking into ways

00:36:00.600 --> 00:36:05.880
to innovate the way that people
navigate through the app.

00:36:05.880 --> 00:36:09.540
If you look at mobile apps right
now or just apps in general,

00:36:09.540 --> 00:36:12.030
those apps are like
very reactive, right?

00:36:12.030 --> 00:36:15.120
You have to click on to do an
actual action while it makes

00:36:15.120 --> 00:36:17.220
much more sense to
do it by intent.

00:36:17.220 --> 00:36:20.940
And now with the LLMs, it
is so much easier to kind

00:36:20.940 --> 00:36:23.550
of like detect that
intent and say, hey,

00:36:23.550 --> 00:36:24.990
I want to do this thing.

00:36:24.990 --> 00:36:27.570
And the app will figure
out how to get there.

00:36:27.570 --> 00:36:28.890
And you don't have
to click a button

00:36:28.890 --> 00:36:30.930
and then find the other menu
and then click that button.

00:36:30.930 --> 00:36:32.610
The app will know
what you want to do.

00:36:32.610 --> 00:36:35.010
It knows the application
and it will take you there.

00:36:35.010 --> 00:36:36.540
That is the AI extensions.

